{"id":"u45","kelas":12,"no":4,"judul":"Membaca untuk Ujian","title":"Reading for Exams","emoji":"📖","ringkas":"Strategi soal bacaan: main idea, inference, dan reference","ready":true,"goals":["mengenali jenis soal bacaan: **main idea**, **detail**, **reference**, **vocabulary in context**, **inference**, **purpose**, dan **tone**","memakai strategi **skimming**, **scanning**, dan eliminasi pilihan","menjawab soal **true / false / not given** dan soal kesimpulan","menentukan **tujuan penulis** (to inform, to persuade, to entertain, to explain)","membaca teks pendek bergaya ujian dan menjawab soalnya dengan cepat","mengelola waktu saat mengerjakan soal bacaan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Soal bacaan hampir selalu muncul dalam ujian akhir. Kuncinya bukan membaca lebih keras, melainkan **membaca dengan strategi**: tahu jenis soal, tahu di mana mencari jawaban, dan tahu cara menyingkirkan pilihan yang salah."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Jenis soal bacaan","table":[["Jenis soal","Bentuk pertanyaan","Strategi"],["**Main idea**","[[What is the text about?]] / [[The main idea of paragraph 2 is ...]]","baca kalimat pertama dan terakhir"],["**Detail**","[[According to the text, when ...?]]","scan kata kunci, cocokkan dengan teks"],["**Reference**","[[The word 'it' in line 4 refers to ...]]","cari kata benda terdekat sebelum kata itu"],["**Vocabulary**","[[The word 'huge' is closest in meaning to ...]]","ganti dengan pilihan, lihat konteks"],["**Inference**","[[What can be inferred from the text?]]","simpulkan dari fakta, bukan dari dugaan"],["**Purpose**","[[The writer wrote the text to ...]]","lihat jenis teks dan nada"],["**True/False**","[[Which statement is true?]]","cek tiap pilihan pada teks"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Tujuan penulis","table":[["Tujuan","Ciri teks","Contoh"],["**to inform**","fakta, data, penjelasan","[[News item, report, explanation]]"],["**to persuade**","opini, ajakan, argumen","[[Exposition, advertisement]]"],["**to entertain**","cerita, humor","[[Narrative, anecdote]]"],["**to instruct**","langkah, perintah","[[Procedure, manual]]"],["**to describe**","ciri-ciri sesuatu","[[Descriptive text]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"main idea","id":"ide pokok","ex":"The main idea is in the first sentence."},{"en":"supporting detail","id":"detail pendukung","ex":"Find a supporting detail."},{"en":"infer","id":"menyimpulkan","ex":"We can infer that he was nervous."},{"en":"imply","id":"menyiratkan","ex":"The writer implies that it is dangerous."},{"en":"purpose","id":"tujuan","ex":"The purpose of the text is to inform."},{"en":"tone","id":"nada / suasana","ex":"The tone of the text is humorous."},{"en":"refer to","id":"merujuk pada","ex":"'They' refers to the students."},{"en":"closest in meaning","id":"paling dekat artinya","ex":"Choose the word closest in meaning."},{"en":"except","id":"kecuali","ex":"All are true except one."},{"en":"paragraph","id":"paragraf","ex":"Read the second paragraph."},{"en":"statement","id":"pernyataan","ex":"Which statement is true?"},{"en":"conclude","id":"menyimpulkan","ex":"We can conclude that she is honest."},{"en":"opinion","id":"pendapat","ex":"The writer gives an opinion."},{"en":"evidence","id":"bukti","ex":"Find evidence in the text."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Strategi menjawab","table":[["Langkah","Penjelasan"],["**1. Baca soal dulu**","tahu apa yang dicari sebelum membaca teks"],["**2. Skim teks**","lihat judul, kalimat pertama tiap paragraf"],["**3. Scan kata kunci**","angka, nama, tanggal, kata tidak biasa"],["**4. Eliminasi**","coret pilihan yang jelas salah atau tidak disebut"],["**5. Cek ulang**","cocokkan jawaban dengan kalimat di teks"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jebakan umum","text":"Pilihan yang memuat kata-kata persis dari teks belum tentu benar. Waspadai kata ekstrem seperti [[always]], [[never]], [[all]], [[only]]. Jawab dari **isi teks**, bukan dari pengetahuanmu sendiri."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: The Value of Sleep","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Many teenagers stay up late to study or play games. However, doctors say that teenagers need eight to ten hours of sleep every night.","id":"Banyak remaja begadang untuk belajar atau bermain game. Namun, dokter mengatakan remaja membutuhkan delapan sampai sepuluh jam tidur setiap malam."},{"who":"Text","en":"Sleep helps the brain to store what we learn. Students who sleep well usually concentrate better and get better marks. On the other hand, tired students often make mistakes.","id":"Tidur membantu otak menyimpan apa yang kita pelajari. Siswa yang tidur cukup biasanya lebih fokus dan mendapat nilai lebih baik. Sebaliknya, siswa yang lelah sering membuat kesalahan."},{"who":"Text","en":"Therefore, schools should start later in the morning, and students should put their phones away one hour before bedtime.","id":"Karena itu, sekolah seharusnya mulai lebih siang, dan siswa sebaiknya menyingkirkan ponsel satu jam sebelum tidur."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: Notice","lines":[{"who":"Notice","en":"LIBRARY NOTICE. From 1 June, the library will open at 7 a.m. and close at 4 p.m. on weekdays. It will be closed on weekends. Students can borrow up to three books for two weeks.","id":"PENGUMUMAN PERPUSTAKAAN. Mulai 1 Juni, perpustakaan buka pukul 7 pagi dan tutup pukul 4 sore pada hari kerja. Perpustakaan tutup pada akhir pekan. Siswa dapat meminjam hingga tiga buku selama dua minggu."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Membahas soal bacaan","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"What is the main idea of the text about sleep, Tom?","id":"Apa ide pokok teks tentang tidur, Tom?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Teenagers need enough sleep, so they can learn better.","id":"Remaja butuh tidur cukup agar dapat belajar lebih baik."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. What is the writer's purpose?","id":"Bagus. Apa tujuan penulis?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"To persuade, because the writer gives opinions with the word 'should'.","id":"Untuk meyakinkan, karena penulis memberi pendapat dengan kata 'should'."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Excellent. You found the clue.","id":"Bagus sekali. Kamu menemukan petunjuknya."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Mengelola waktu","text":"Jika satu soal terlalu sulit, **lewati** dulu dan kembali nanti. Beri sekitar 1 menit per soal bacaan. Selalu sisakan 5 menit di akhir untuk memeriksa ulang."},{"t":"summary","items":["Kenali jenis soal: main idea, detail, reference, vocabulary, inference, purpose.","Urutan: baca soal → skim → scan → eliminasi → cek ulang.","Tujuan penulis: **inform, persuade, entertain, instruct, describe**.","Waspadai kata ekstrem ([[always]], [[never]], [[all]], [[only]]).","Jawab dari **isi teks**, bukan pengetahuan sendiri."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis soal dengan strateginya:","pairs":[["main idea","baca kalimat pertama"],["detail","scan kata kunci"],["reference","cari kata benda sebelumnya"],["vocabulary","lihat konteks"]],"exp":"Strategi tiap jenis soal.","k":"dfaa1959"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tujuan penulis dengan jenis teks:","pairs":[["to inform","news item"],["to persuade","exposition"],["to entertain","narrative"],["to instruct","procedure"]],"exp":"Tujuan penulis.","k":"25817e0a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["infer","menyimpulkan"],["tone","nada"],["except","kecuali"],["evidence","bukti"],["statement","pernyataan"]],"exp":"Kosakata soal bacaan.","k":"c13653fd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, berapa jam tidur yang dibutuhkan remaja?","options":["delapan sampai sepuluh jam","lima sampai enam jam","dua belas jam","tiga jam"],"answer":0,"exp":"Eight to ten hours.","k":"5a81fe34"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ide pokok Teks 1 adalah...","options":["remaja butuh tidur cukup","remaja suka game","dokter itu sibuk","sekolah dimulai pukul tujuh"],"answer":0,"exp":"Seluruh teks membahas pentingnya tidur.","k":"98c6f6a9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan penulis Teks 1 adalah...","options":["to persuade","to entertain","to instruct","to describe"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ada should dan ajakan.","k":"c1461f49"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"Therefore\" pada Teks 1 menunjukkan...","options":["kesimpulan atau akibat","contoh","kontras","urutan pertama"],"answer":0,"exp":"Therefore = oleh karena itu.","k":"a97d49d0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"On the other hand\" pada Teks 1 dipakai untuk...","options":["menunjukkan sisi lain","menutup teks","memberi contoh","memulai langkah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kontras.","k":"392d0cec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, siswa yang tidur cukup biasanya...","options":["lebih fokus dan nilainya lebih baik","lebih lelah","sering lupa","lebih lambat"],"answer":0,"exp":"Concentrate better and get better marks.","k":"ba251a4f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kesimpulan yang masuk akal dari Teks 1 adalah...","options":["begadang dapat mengganggu belajar","game itu wajib","sekolah harus libur","dokter melarang belajar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Disimpulkan dari fakta.","k":"ce7af41b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 2, perpustakaan buka pukul...","options":["7 pagi","8 pagi","9 pagi","10 pagi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Open at 7 a.m.","k":"880b89fb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 2, perpustakaan tutup pada...","options":["akhir pekan","hari Senin","hari Rabu","setiap pagi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Closed on weekends.","k":"68b79ab7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 2, siswa dapat meminjam...","options":["tiga buku selama dua minggu","dua buku selama tiga minggu","lima buku selama sebulan","satu buku selama sehari"],"answer":0,"exp":"Up to three books for two weeks.","k":"d5c9edf5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks 2 bertujuan untuk...","options":["memberi informasi","menghibur","meyakinkan","memberi perintah memasak"],"answer":0,"exp":"Notice = informasi.","k":"67f5d727"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pernyataan \"The library is open on Sunday\" menurut Teks 2 adalah...","options":["false","true","not given","unclear"],"answer":0,"exp":"Library closed on weekends.","k":"3a3c47d5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks hanya menyebut \"She likes tea.\" Pernyataan \"She likes coffee\" adalah...","options":["not given","true","false","correct"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak disebut.","k":"77569f9d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Menurut teks, remaja butuh tidur.","q":"___ to the text, teenagers need sleep.","answers":["according","According"],"hint":"menurut","exp":"According to.","k":"9e9e2b88"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kata they merujuk pada para siswa.","q":"'They' ___ to the students.","answers":["refers"],"hint":"merujuk","exp":"refers to.","k":"2045257b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita dapat menyimpulkan bahwa dia lelah.","q":"We can ___ that he was tired.","answers":["infer","conclude"],"hint":"menyimpulkan","exp":"infer / conclude.","k":"6ffc3559"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tujuan penulis adalah memberi informasi.","q":"The writer's ___ is to inform.","answers":["purpose"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"purpose.","k":"f0e2d551"},{"type":"fill","id":"Semua benar kecuali satu.","q":"All are true ___ one.","answers":["except"],"hint":"kecuali","exp":"except.","k":"89f0b2ed"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ide pokok ada di kalimat pertama.\"","answer":"The main idea is in the first sentence.","exp":"The main idea is in ...","k":"34e2cd63"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tujuan teks ini adalah meyakinkan pembaca.\"","answer":"The purpose of this text is to persuade readers.","exp":"The purpose of ... is to + V1.","k":"4847dc5f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Which statement is true according to the text","options":["Pernyataan mana yang benar menurut teks","Siapa yang menulis teks","Kapan teks dibuat","Apa judul teksnya"],"answer":0,"exp":"true = benar.","k":"755e8c4f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The word it refers to the book","options":["Kata it merujuk pada buku itu","Buku itu mahal","Aku membaca buku","Kata it salah"],"answer":0,"exp":"refers to = merujuk pada.","k":"8ceda94f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Choose the word closest in meaning","options":["Pilih kata yang paling dekat artinya","Tulis kata baru","Hapus kata itu","Ejalah kata itu"],"answer":0,"exp":"closest in meaning.","k":"d0c7e6ef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya menemukan jawabannya dengan scanning.","q":"I found the answer by ___.","answers":["scanning"],"hint":"mencari cepat","exp":"scanning.","k":"109dd794"},{"type":"fill","id":"Baca teks dengan cepat untuk gambaran umum.","q":"___ the text for the general idea.","answers":["skim","Skim"],"hint":"baca cepat","exp":"skim.","k":"fcf7f5c7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jawabannya ada di paragraf kedua.","q":"The answer is in the ___ paragraph.","answers":["second"],"hint":"kedua","exp":"second.","k":"28fdb2b2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Nada teks itu lucu.","q":"The ___ of the text is humorous.","answers":["tone"],"hint":"nada","exp":"tone.","k":"c02c4816"},{"type":"fill","id":"Teks itu bertujuan menghibur.","q":"The text is written to ___ readers.","answers":["entertain"],"hint":"menghibur","exp":"entertain.","k":"9314ae21"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pernyataan itu tidak disebutkan dalam teks.","q":"The statement is not ___ in the text.","answers":["mentioned","given"],"hint":"disebutkan","exp":"mentioned / given.","k":"0e3d7118"},{"type":"fill","id":"Coret pilihan yang jelas salah.","q":"Cross out the options that are clearly ___.","answers":["wrong","false","incorrect"],"hint":"salah","exp":"wrong.","k":"93f83e80"},{"type":"fill","id":"Periksa kembali jawabanmu.","q":"___ your answers again.","answers":["check","Check"],"hint":"periksa","exp":"check.","k":"12b0d717"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"huge\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["very big","very small","very old","very new"],"answer":0,"exp":"huge = very big.","k":"f2abd30a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"tiny\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["very small","very big","very fast","very cold"],"answer":0,"exp":"tiny.","k":"77654bac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"rapid\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["fast","slow","quiet","heavy"],"answer":0,"exp":"rapid = fast.","k":"b7393cf9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"require\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["need","refuse","forget","finish"],"answer":0,"exp":"require = need.","k":"61e0a905"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"prevent\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["stop","start","help","invite"],"answer":0,"exp":"prevent = stop.","k":"02f1374b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Tom took his umbrella and a raincoat.\" Kesimpulan yang masuk akal...","options":["cuaca akan hujan","cuaca panas","Tom akan berenang","Tom sedang tidur"],"answer":0,"exp":"Inference.","k":"bad05d34"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Dina's eyes were red and she kept yawning.\" Kesimpulan yang masuk akal...","options":["Dina mengantuk","Dina bersemangat","Dina bahagia sekali","Dina sedang berlari"],"answer":0,"exp":"Inference.","k":"47e56ac4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks: \"The shop opens at 9 and closes at 5.\" Toko buka selama...","options":["delapan jam","lima jam","sembilan jam","empat jam"],"answer":0,"exp":"9 sampai 17.","k":"44177542"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang bertujuan to instruct?","options":["Mix the flour and add the eggs.","Once upon a time, a king lived.","A fire destroyed the market.","Schools should start later."],"answer":0,"exp":"Procedure.","k":"70af3ee1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang bertujuan to entertain?","options":["Once upon a time, a clever mouse deer lived in a forest.","Boil the water.","The shop opens at 9.","Students must wear uniforms."],"answer":0,"exp":"Narrative.","k":"f892052b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang bertujuan to persuade?","options":["We should plant more trees to protect our city.","A tree has leaves.","Trees are green.","I saw a tree yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"Ada should dan alasan.","k":"8d708f3a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang bertujuan to inform?","options":["The museum is open from 9 to 4 on weekdays.","You must visit the museum!","Imagine a magical museum.","Add water to the museum."],"answer":0,"exp":"Informasi faktual.","k":"8ad15e85"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Judul terbaik untuk teks tentang manfaat olahraga adalah...","options":["Why Exercise Matters","My Pet Cat","Fire in the Market","Job Interview Tips"],"answer":0,"exp":"Judul mewakili ide pokok.","k":"85eb5e9a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pernyataan mana yang terlalu ekstrem?","options":["Everyone always loves homework.","Many students like music.","Some people read daily.","Several teachers agreed."],"answer":0,"exp":"everyone always.","k":"1edad18a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian teks yang biasanya memuat ide pokok adalah...","options":["kalimat pertama paragraf","nomor halaman","tanda baca","catatan kaki"],"answer":0,"exp":"Topic sentence.","k":"8b5d3eab"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Coret pilihan yang salah.\"","answer":"Cross out the wrong options.","exp":"Cross out + objek.","k":"d1f367ce"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan sinonim:","pairs":[["huge","very big"],["rapid","fast"],["require","need"],["purchase","buy"]],"exp":"Sinonim.","k":"2f8b1f79"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Scan the text to find the answer","options":["Pindai teks untuk mencari jawaban","Salin teks itu","Jangan baca teks","Hafalkan teks"],"answer":0,"exp":"scan.","k":"75716693"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"What can be inferred from the passage","options":["Apa yang dapat disimpulkan dari bacaan itu","Siapa yang menulis bacaan","Kapan bacaan dibuat","Di mana bacaan dijual"],"answer":0,"exp":"inferred = disimpulkan.","k":"81f4b1f1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gagasan utama biasanya ada di kalimat ___.","q":"The main idea is usually in the topic ___.","answers":["sentence"],"hint":"kalimat","exp":"topic sentence.","k":"f637bccb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Penulis ingin meyakinkan pembaca.","q":"The writer wants to ___ the readers.","answers":["persuade","convince"],"hint":"meyakinkan","exp":"persuade.","k":"56810122"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kata \"they\" merujuk pada orang yang disebut sebelumnya.","q":"\"They\" is a pronoun that ___ to people mentioned before.","answers":["refers"],"hint":"merujuk","exp":"refers.","k":"526082f2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dari bacaan, kita dapat menyimpulkan bahwa dia sedih.","q":"From the text, we can ___ that she is sad.","answers":["infer","conclude"],"hint":"menyimpulkan","exp":"infer.","k":"109ec90d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tujuan penulis disebut author's ___.","q":"The writer's aim is the author's ___.","answers":["purpose"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"purpose.","k":"fe4c4fef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Nada tulisan disebut ___.","q":"The attitude of the writer is the ___.","answers":["tone"],"hint":"nada","exp":"tone.","k":"a402c677"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pindai teks untuk mencari tanggal. Teknik ini disebut ___.","q":"Looking quickly for a specific detail is called ___.","answers":["scanning"],"hint":"mencari cepat","exp":"scanning.","k":"dd8cadd2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Membaca cepat untuk gambaran umum disebut ___.","q":"Reading quickly for the general idea is called ___.","answers":["skimming"],"hint":"membaca sekilas","exp":"skimming.","k":"e03282f5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kata \"however\" menunjukkan pertentangan.","q":"\"However\" shows ___.","answers":["contrast"],"hint":"pertentangan","exp":"contrast.","k":"3dfd06a5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pertanyaan \"The writer's attitude is...\" menanyakan...","options":["nada/sikap penulis","jumlah paragraf","judul","tahun"],"answer":0,"exp":"Attitude.","k":"340459b6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"The word 'enormous' is closest in meaning to...\" menanyakan...","options":["sinonim","antonim","tujuan","judul"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sinonim.","k":"05895f4f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang \"implied\" berarti...","options":["tersirat","tersurat","salah","dihapus"],"answer":0,"exp":"implied.","k":"f982182d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks: \"Few students passed the test.\" Artinya...","options":["Hanya sedikit siswa yang lulus.","Banyak siswa lulus.","Semua lulus.","Tidak ada ujian."],"answer":0,"exp":"few = sedikit.","k":"6e54977c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"